      model: { et: "Ma räägin sellest, kas raamatut on tänapäeval veel vaja. Minu meelest on, ja mul on selleks kaks põhjust. Esiteks loeb inimene paberil paremini kui ekraanilt. Kui ma loen telefonist uudiseid, loen ma tihti ainult esimese lause, aga raamatut loen ma lõpuni. Teiseks paneb hea raamat mõtlema. Meie klubis lugesime hiljuti romaani, mille lõpp jäi lahtiseks, ja vaidlesime selle üle terve õhtu. Telefoniga ma nii kaua ei mõtle, sest seal tuleb kohe midagi uut. Muidugi on ekraanil ka oma hea külg: see on kerge ja alati käes. Aga lõpuks arvan ma, et raamat jääb meiega veel kaua.", en: "I'm going to talk about whether we still need books today. To my mind we do, and I have two reasons for it. First, people read better on paper than off a screen. When I read the news on my phone I often read only the first sentence, but a book I read to the end. Second, a good book makes you think. At our club we recently read a novel whose ending was left open, and we argued about it all evening. With a phone I don't think that long, because something new comes along straight away. Of course a screen has its good side too: it's light and always to hand. But in the end I think books will be with us for a long while yet." },
